# OrbitOS: Aomi Skills

Aomi is installed via `.agents/skills/` from `aomi-labs/skills`. Use **all installed skills** when relevant to the task.

## All skills

| Skill | Use for |
|-------|---------|
| **aomi-transact** | Chat-based on-chain actions — swaps, launches, monitoring, wallet-signed EVM flows |
| **aomi-build** | Protocol-specific tools — scaffold Zora, Aerodrome, Avantis integrations from API specs |
| **manage-aomi-skill** | Install, update, or configure Aomi skills in the project |
| **coinbase-agentkit** | Coinbase AgentKit — wallets, swaps, contracts, NFTs on Base and other EVM chains |
| **brian-api** | Natural language → Web3 transactions across chains |
| **goat** | GOAT toolkit — broad DeFi/protocol integrations across many chains |
| **eliza** | elizaOS multi-agent framework — personality, plugins, platform connectors |
| **solana-agent-kit** | Solana-specific agent actions and integrations |
| **x402** | HTTP 402 agent payments and agent-to-agent commerce |
| **crypto-skill-creator** | Author new crypto/Web3 agent skills |

## OrbitOS mapping

- `src/components/chat/aomi-chat.tsx` → **aomi-transact** (+ **brian-api**, **goat** when useful)
- Protocol cards (Zora, Aerodrome, Avantis, Monad) → **aomi-build**
- Connect Wallet / Base Network → **coinbase-agentkit**, **aomi-transact**
- Monad / multi-chain → **goat**, **aomi-transact**
- Solana flows → **solana-agent-kit**
- Agent payments → **x402**
- New protocol skill → **crypto-skill-creator**, **manage-aomi-skill**

## When to read skills

Read the relevant `SKILL.md` under `.agents/skills/<skill-name>/` before implementing features that depend on it.
